{"version":1,"content":"<p>早在本周黃仁勳風波爆發之前，英偉達投資者就已經轉向看空。但過去幾日，華爾街拋售進一步加劇，該股或將迎來周線六連跌，為2012年以來最長連跌周期。這家晶片巨頭今年大部分時間都是全球市值最高企業，截至周四收盤，這段時間市值已經蒸發29%，縮水約1.6萬億美元，市值也被蘋果反超。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586266.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:19:46.746185+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:07:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:05.888421+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:05.888421+00:00","content_hash":"3ecfc50b46558985aafc1c4e10fba143daab1fc576bd537677c9cd6fb78f95a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}